  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional Capacity for Municipality of Pristina</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The activity of the local self-government in Kosovo is based on the Constitution and laws of Kosovo which are aligned with the European Charter on Local Self-Government. The current system of competences of municipalities is based on the Law on Local Self-Governance Articles 15-23 (also Article 124.3 of the Constitution). Overall, significant competences are devolved to municipalities, which represent the basic units of governance. Own competencies provide municipalities with sufficient autonomy</narrative>
  </description>
